  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Trinket_items\" title=\"Category:Trinket items\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_ItemSlot_Trinket.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trinket\">Trinket</span></h2>\n<table class=\"striped\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #FFBBBB solid; margin: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#FFBBBB;--bg-color-1-dark:#573F3F;--bg-color-2:#FFE4E1;--bg-color-2-dark:#3D2C2A;--header-color:#FFBBBB;--header-color-dark:#573F3F;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\" width=\"15%\">Minimum level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"42.5%\">None\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"11\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Trinket_Generic.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Trinket_Generic.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"398\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Item Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">Jewelry / Trinket\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\"><a href=\"/page/Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Slot\">Slot</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">Trinket\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Race Absolutely Required\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/None\" title=\"None\">None</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">90\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Gem_(material)\" title=\"Gem (material)\">Gem</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Gem_(material)\" title=\"Gem (material)\">Gem</a>:</b> Items made of <b>gem</b> are generally extremely durable and have a very high <a href=\"/page/Hardness\" title=\"Hardness\">hardness</a>. Most commonly used to make trinkets and docents.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">28\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\" width=\"150\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"450\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0000915000</span>915<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Random\" title=\"Random\">Random</a></b>, and <b><a href=\"/page/DDO_Store\" title=\"DDO Store\">DDO Store</a></b> and special events (e.g. <a href=\"/page/Snowpeaks_Festival\" title=\"Snowpeaks Festival\">Snowpeaks Festival</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Essence_Crafting\" title=\"Essence Crafting\">Craftable </a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Essence_Crafting\" title=\"Essence Crafting\">Craftable </a>:</b>  This item can be enhanced via <a href=\"/page/Essence_Crafting\" title=\"Essence Crafting\">Essence Crafting</a>.</span></span> (hidden)</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Trinket.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Trinket.png/420px-Trinket.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"218\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Trinket.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Essence_Crafting\" title=\"Essence Crafting\">Essence Crafting</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>A small trinket capable of being imbued with magical effects.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Item:Gem_of_Many_Facets\" title=\"Item:Gem of Many Facets\">Gem of Many Facets</a> (or its <a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Gem_of_Many_Facets\" title=\"Item:Epic Gem of Many Facets\">epic</a> and <a href=\"/page/Item:Legendary_Gem_of_Many_Facets\" title=\"Item:Legendary Gem of Many Facets\">legendary</a> version) is strictly superior to plain trinket. It comes with a Yellow augment slot and is part of named item sets.\n</p><p>It is not possible to apply shards with effects until you disjunct the item (<span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forums-old.ddo.com/forums/showthread.php/327580\">DDO Forums</a></span>&#160;<sup id=\"old&#95;forums&#95;link&#95;1\" style=\"background-color: #FFAAAA;\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/save/https%3A%2F%2Fforums-old.ddo.com%2Fforums%2Fshowthread.php%2F327580\"><abbr title=\"The old forums this link points to were shut down on August 31st, 2025. If this is important, please consider revising the template call as described at &#91;&#91;Template:Forums&#93;&#93;.\" style=\"display: initial;\">ARCHIVE ME!</abbr></a></sup>)\n</p><p>Craftable trinket from the DDO Store is BtA (<span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forums-old.ddo.com/forums/showthread.php?p=3998159#post3998159\">DDO Forums</a></span>&#160;<sup id=\"old&#95;forums&#95;link&#95;2\" style=\"background-color: #FFAAAA;\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/save/https%3A%2F%2Fforums-old.ddo.com%2Fforums%2Fshowthread.php%3Fp%3D3998159%23post3998159\"><abbr title=\"The old forums this link points to were shut down on August 31st, 2025. If this is important, please consider revising the template call as described at &#91;&#91;Template:Forums&#93;&#93;.\" style=\"display: initial;\">ARCHIVE ME!</abbr></a></sup>).\n</p><p>You can turn the item into BtA version by applying a BtA shard.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816175301\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.112 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2858/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25807/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6445/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n142.08%  134.066     43 Template:IO\n100.00%   94.359      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   94.359      1 -total\n 96.95%   91.483      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 47.54%   44.860      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 46.64%   44.006      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 45.60%   43.032      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 44.52%   42.008      2 Template:InCategory\n 18.63%   17.581      1 Template:Mat\n 18.45%   17.407      3 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:25690-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816175301 and revision id 682872. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
